<div  data-component-id="radix:block" class="block block-core block-page-title-block block--collection-page-title"><div class="block__content"><h1  class="title page-title"><span>Forms</span></h1></div></div><div  data-component-id="radix:block" class="block block-system block-system-main-block block--collection-mainpagecontent block--system-main"><div class="block__content"><div data-component-id="radix:node" class="node page page--full node--full node--page--full view-mode--full"><div  class="node__content"><div  class="_none"><div  class="w-100"><div  class="BasicRow layout row layout-builder__layout"><div  class="col-12 BasicColOne"><div  data-component-id="radix:block" class="block block-layout-builder block-field-blocknodepagebody"><div class="block__content"><div  data-component-id="radix:field" class="field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field--item"><p>​​​​​This section is for all forms for updating personal information, business/branch information, changing status of license, transferring brokers, and complaints. For education related forms, please see <a href="/providers-and-instructors" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="2714d8b0-1cd9-4b3a-95d3-6f519d6e5f10" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Providers and Instructors">Providers &amp; Instructors</a>. For exam and license applications, please see​ <a href="/licensing" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="9d319cdd-5ad1-42be-b8b0-98361a951fa2" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Licensing">Licensing</a>. Please ensure all fees and pertinent documentation is submitted when mailing them into the Commission. Online payments for all change filings and certificates of licensure are not available at this time.​ Visit this link for more information on a <a href="/national-criminal-background-check" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="cf9b3e55-76f0-4866-a072-6e46edca6a7b" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="National Criminal Background Check">criminal background check​</a>.​</p><hr><h2>Change Filing Forms</h2><h3>Instructions for Change of Broker:</h3><p><strong>**For salesperson and associate broker transfers ONLY**​</strong></p><p>If you are a <strong>broker</strong> wishing to become an associate broker or salesperson, fill out a second license application.​</p><p>If you are changing the <strong>principal broker</strong> of a company, please contact the licensing department at <a href="mailto:reclicensing@wv.gov" title="Email the Licensing Department">reclicensing@wv.gov</a>.&nbsp;</p><hr><h4>To transfer ​your salesperson/associate broker license, please follow these steps:</h4><ul><li>​The transferring licensee shall submit, in writing, to his/her current broker they are seeking a transfer from the current responsible broker.</li><li>The​ current employing broker shall promptly sign and date the license with the last date of employment and email the signed license to <a href="mailto:wvrec@wv.gov" title="Email WV Real Estate Division">wvrec@wv.gov</a> and to the licensee to be uploaded with the Change of Employing Broker Form.</li><li>The licensee and new responsible broker will complete the form (below) and upload it with the​​ signed license as one PDF through the online application here: <a href="https://apps.wv.gov/REC/Licensing/Change/Change/Index" target="_blank">REC Licensing- Change of Employing Broker</a> OR through the mail to the Commission with fees.​</li><li><a href="/media/39/download?inline" target="_blank" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="bafbdd71-d025-4b08-acb4-7b045ac57c6f" data-entity-substitution="media_download_inline" title="Change of Employing Broker Form">Change of Employing Broker Form</a> (used to change offices in the same brokerage, for example moving from a branch office to the main office)</li></ul><hr><h2>Change Forms​​</h2><ul><li><a href="/media/38/download?inline" target="_blank" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="71e7d91b-e69f-4d8b-ac66-1776eb86c892" data-entity-substitution="media_download_inline" title="License Status​ Change">License Status ​Change​</a></li><li><a href="/media/37/download?inline" target="_blank" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="1833f765-697e-4025-b705-88ca1ba2b554" data-entity-substitution="media_download_inline" title="​​​Change of Company Address">Change of Company Addres</a>s​​</li><li><a href="/media/36/download?inline" target="_blank" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="baec03fb-9152-4e14-af41-df3b0271a4e1" data-entity-substitution="media_download_inline" title="Change of Company Name">Change of Company Name</a>​</li><li><a href="/media/35/download?inline" target="_blank" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="b26bd02f-b436-4d70-b286-c8dc10aa7607" data-entity-substitution="media_download_inline" title="Change of Licensee Name">Change of Licensee Name​​</a></li></ul><h2>Licensing Forms</h2><ul><li>​​​<a href="/media/45/download?inline" target="_blank" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="fb195e4d-3d38-444f-8245-d0077ac1c9ce" data-entity-substitution="media_download_inline" title="Verification of Sponsoring Broker">Verification of Sponsoring Broker​</a></li><li><a href="/media/32/download?inline" target="_blank" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="032a965b-3a04-4856-8768-6da48054d38c" data-entity-substitution="media_download_inline" title="Trust Fund Account Consent">Trust Fund Account</a> or <a href="/media/33/download?inline" target="_blank" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="2f537dac-1c53-42eb-91ea-7ccee1ab66f9" data-entity-substitution="media_download_inline" title="Trust Fund ​Account Waiver">Waiver</a></li><li><a href="/media/42/download?inline" target="_blank" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="37da01b3-8f9e-43fe-a39f-6ee7050a5084" data-entity-substitution="media_download_inline" title="Subordination Resolution">Subordination Resolution</a></li><li><a href="/media/41/download?inline" target="_blank" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="c0408f4c-9e67-4a74-a2d2-ea8b2828c9a4" data-entity-substitution="media_download_inline" title="Irrevocable Consent">Irrevocable Consent​</a></li><li><a href="https://urldefense.com/v3/__https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1Ibdzw2Yx32TZkVixJpt21xlEzqpePpOCo43OF_uA4Kw/edit?usp=sharing__;!!A69Ausm6DtA!Yagzn3j76MJDMcRoXnGXIWhrlL67wTmCfhltIEvBTh6_5Nbha7lEtLQZOe3XGbCM9wV6ZOyu4QJ6LcVXVqNV95uJ1at5Jg$" target="_blank">Closed Transactions​ Form</a>​</li><li><a href="/media/40/download?inline" target="_blank" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="db944a7c-0120-4619-a805-340e92f08c45" data-entity-substitution="media_download_inline" title="Affidavit of Broker's Recommendation​​">Affidavit of Broker's Recommendation​​​​</a></li></ul><h2>Additional Forms</h2><ul><li><a href="/media/27/download?inline" target="_blank" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="effcfc31-7eff-4b1a-9e26-7127bbd6005b" data-entity-substitution="media_download_inline" title="Branch Office Application">Branch Office Application​</a></li><li><a href="/media/28/download?inline" target="_blank" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="ee4171fb-53a1-4673-824b-1df31b712ca2" data-entity-substitution="media_download_inline" title="Complaint Form">Complaint Form</a>​​</li><li><a href="/media/29/download?inline" target="_blank" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="284aa7eb-9b22-498c-ae97-d5318d541030" data-entity-substitution="media_download_inline" title="Application for Waiver of In​itial Licensing Fee">Application for Waiver of Initial Licensing Fee​​​​​</a></li><li><a href="/media/30/download?inline" target="_blank" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="9274793c-e45a-4246-8a45-9b0262400e2f" data-entity-substitution="media_download_inline" title="Noti​c​e ​of Agency">Notice of Agency</a> (rev. 10.24.24)</li><li><a href="/media/31/download?inline" target="_blank" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="5b1d94c8-0726-41aa-bb9f-13cd77accb55" data-entity-substitution="media_download_inline" title="A Guide to Agency Relationships">A Guide to Agency Relationships​</a></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div  class="_none"><div  class="w-100"><div  class="layout row layout-builder__layout"><div  class="col-12 GalleryBlockClass"><div  class="views-element-container block block-views block-views-blockgallery-block-block-1" data-component-id="radix:block"><div class="block__content"><div><div  data-component-id="radix:views-view" class="view view-gallery-block view-id-gallery_block view-display-id-block_1 js-view-dom-id-62c7b508c11edeac091d032c256b304355d77132b13f7aa6f383f96e5ffd6320"><div  class="view-content"><div id="views-bootstrap-gallery-block-block-1"  class="grid GalleryImageViewRow views-view-grid row"><div class="GalleryImageViewCol col-12 col-sm-6 col-md-4 col-lg-3 col-xl-2 col-xxl-2"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="container-fluid contentbottom"></div><div class="row"></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="wv-footer"><div class="agency-footer"><div class="container-fluid"><div class="row"><div class="col-12 col-md-6"><div class="agyftadr">


